{
  "bv1:0.1": "suttantapiṭake khuddakanikāyassa ",
  "bv1:0.2": "buddhavaṃso ",
  "bv1:1.1": "namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa. ratanacaṅkamanakaṇḍo ",
  "bv1:2.1": "brahmā ca lokādhipatī samahpati ",
  "bv1:2.2": "katañjalī anadhivaraṃ ayācatha ",
  "bv1:2.3": "santīdha sattā appa rajakkha jātikā ",
  "bv1:2.4": "desehi dhammaṃ anukampimaṃ pajanti. [bhagavā lokādhipatī naruttamo katañjalī brahma gaṇehi yācito santīdha dhīrāppa rajakkhajātikā desetu dhammaṃ anukampimaṃ pajaṃ. ",
  "bv1:3.1": "desetu sugato dhammaṃ desetu amataṃ padaṃ lokānamanukampāya dhammaṃ desetu nāyaka]. sampannavijjā caraṇassa tādino ",
  "bv1:3.2": "jutindharassantimadehadhārino ",
  "bv1:3.3": "tathāgatassap paṭipuggalassa ",
  "bv1:3.4": "uppajji kāruññatā sabbasatte. ",
  "bv1:4.1": "[taṃ sutvā bhagavā satthā idaṃ vacanamabravi] apārutā te amatassa dvārā ye sotavanto pamuñcantu saddhaṃ vihiṃsa saññī paguṇaṃ na bhāsiṃ dhammaṃ paṇītaṃ manujesu brahmeti. [bhagavā tasmiṃ samaye veneyyānaṃ nukampako ajapālanigrodhadumā pāyāsi munipuṅgavo. anukkamena gamanena bārāṇasimupāgami tasmiṃ hi pallaṅkavare nisīdi bhagavā tadā. pañcannaṃ vaggiyānañca dhammacakkampavattayi dukkhaṃ dukkhasamuppādaṃ nirodhaṃ maggamuttamaṃ. pavattayi taṃ bhagavā isī te pañcavaggiyā aṭṭhārasakoṭi tadā brahma deva gaṇā saha. paṭhamasmiṃ sannipāte dhammābhisamayā labhu koṇḍañño bhaddiyo vappo mahānāmo ca assaji. vinītā tena parena sabbepi anupubbaso aṭṭhārasakoṭi tadā brahma deva gaṇā saha. paṭhamasmiṃ sannipāte sotāpattiphalaṃ tadā anukkamena gamanena rājagahamupāgami. veḷuvanamahāvihāre vihāsi munipuṅgavo taṃ sutvā bimbisāro ca bhagavantamupasaṅkami. ekādasanahuteneva parivārā mahā ahu dīpa gandha dhūpa mālādīni bhagavantamabhipūjayi. tasmiṃ samāgameyeva kāmādīnava desayi desanāpariyosāne rājānampamukhaṃ tadā. caturāsītisahassānaṃ dhammābhisamayo ahu taṃ sutvāna pitā rājā nava dūtāni pesayi. nava sahassa parivārehi pabbajjaṃ yācate muniṃ nava sahassa parivārā arahattamupāgamuṃ. kāḷudāyi pariyosāne bhikkhuvesaṃ gahetvā so sahassa parivārehi bhagavantaṃ nimantayi. nimantamadhivāsetvā mahāmaggaṃ paṭipajjati vīsatisahassabhikkhūhi pāyāsi sakya puṅgavo. anukkamena gamanena kapilavatthumupāgami rohiṇiyā nadītīre pāṭihāramakāsi so. tasmiṃ pallaṅkamajjhamhi nisīdi sakya puṅgavo mahāvessantaradhammaṃ desetvā bhagavā pitu caturāsītisahassānaṃ dhammābhisamayo ahu]. na hete jānanti sadeva manussā ",
  "bv1:4.2": "buddho ayaṃ kīdisako naruttamo ",
  "bv1:4.3": "iddhibalaṃ paññābalañca kīdisaṃ ",
  "bv1:4.4": "buddhabalaṃ lokahitassa kīdisaṃ. ",
  "bv1:5.1": "na hete jānanti sadeva manussā ",
  "bv1:5.2": "buddho ayaṃ īdisako naruttamo ",
  "bv1:5.3": "iddhibalaṃ paññābalañca īdisaṃ ",
  "bv1:5.4": "buddhabalaṃ lokahitassa īdisaṃ. ",
  "bv1:6.1": "handāhaṃ dassayissāmi ",
  "bv1:6.2": "buddhabalaṃ anuttaraṃ ",
  "bv1:6.3": "caṅkamaṃ māpayissāmi ",
  "bv1:6.4": "nabhe ratanamaṇḍitaṃ. ",
  "bv1:7.1": "bhummā mahārājikā tāvatiṃsā ",
  "bv1:7.2": "yāmā ca devā tusitā ca nimmitā ",
  "bv1:7.3": "paranimmitā yepica brahmakāyikā ",
  "bv1:7.4": "ānanditā vipulamakaṃsu ghosaṃ. ",
  "bv1:8.1": "obhāsitā ca paṭhavī sadevakā ",
  "bv1:8.2": "puthū ca lokantarikā asaṃvutā ",
  "bv1:8.3": "tamo ca tibbo vihato tadā ahu ",
  "bv1:8.4": "disvāna accherakapāṭihīraṃ. sadeva gandhabba manussa ",
  "bv1:9.1": "rakkhase ",
  "bv1:9.2": "ābhā uḷārā vipulā ajāyatha ",
  "bv1:9.3": "imasmiṃ loke parasmiṃ ",
  "bv1:9.4": "cūbhaye adhopi uddhaṃ tiriyañca vitthataṃ. ",
  "bv1:10.1": "sattuttamo anadhivaro vināyako ",
  "bv1:10.2": "satthā ahu deva manussa pūjito ",
  "bv1:10.3": "mahānubhāvo sata puñña lakkhaṇo ",
  "bv1:10.4": "dassesi accheraka pāṭihīriyaṃ. [tasmiṃ samāgame satthā abbhuggantvā nabhe tale sineru pabbataṃ rammaṃ caṅkamaṃ māpayī jino. dasasahassi lokadhātu- devatā jinasantike tathāgataṃ namassitvā buddhapūjaṃ kariṃsu te]. ",
  "bv1:11.1": "so yācito devavarena cakkhumā ",
  "bv1:11.2": "atthaṃ samekkhitvā tadā naruttamo ",
  "bv1:11.3": "caṅkamaṃ māpayi lokanāyako ",
  "bv1:11.4": "suniṭṭhitaṃ sabbaratananimmitaṃ. ",
  "bv1:12.1": "iddhi ca ādesanānusāsanī ",
  "bv1:12.2": "tipāṭihīre bhagavā vasī ahu ",
  "bv1:12.3": "caṅkamaṃ māpayi lokanāyako ",
  "bv1:12.4": "suniṭṭhitaṃ sabbaratananimmitaṃ. ",
  "bv1:13.1": "dasasahassi lokadhātuyā ",
  "bv1:13.2": "sineru pabbatuttame ",
  "bv1:13.3": "thambheva dassesi paṭipāṭiyā ",
  "bv1:13.4": "caṅkame ratanāmaye. ",
  "bv1:14.1": "dasasahassaṃ atikkamma ",
  "bv1:14.2": "caṅkamaṃ māpayī jino ",
  "bv1:14.3": "sabba sovaṇṇamayā passe ",
  "bv1:14.4": "caṅkame ratanāmaye. ",
  "bv1:15.1": "tulāsaṅghāṭānuvattā sovaṇṇa ",
  "bv1:15.2": "phalakatthakā ",
  "bv1:15.3": "vedikā sabba sovaṇṇā ",
  "bv1:15.4": "dubhato passesu nimmitā. ",
  "bv1:16.1": "maṇi muttā vālukākiṇṇo ",
  "bv1:16.2": "nimmito ratanāmayo ",
  "bv1:16.3": "obhāseti disā sabbā ",
  "bv1:16.4": "sataraṃsīva uggato. ",
  "bv1:17.1": "tasmiṃ caṅkamane dhīro ",
  "bv1:17.2": "dvattiṃsa varalakkhaṇo ",
  "bv1:17.3": "virocamāno sambuddho ",
  "bv1:17.4": "caṅkame caṅkamī jino. ",
  "bv1:18.1": "dibbaṃ mandāravaṃ pupphaṃ ",
  "bv1:18.2": "padumaṃ pārichattakaṃ ",
  "bv1:18.3": "caṅkamane okiranti ",
  "bv1:18.4": "sabbe devā samāgatā. ",
  "bv1:19.1": "passanti taṃ devasaṅghā ",
  "bv1:19.2": "dasasahassī samāgatā ",
  "bv1:19.3": "namassamānā nipatanti ",
  "bv1:19.4": "tuṭṭha haṭṭhā pamoditā. ",
  "bv1:20.1": "tāvatiṃsā ca yāmā ca ",
  "bv1:20.2": "tusitā cāpi devatā ",
  "bv1:20.3": "nimmānaratino devā ",
  "bv1:20.4": "ye devā vasavattino ",
  "bv1:20.5": "udaggacittā sumanā ",
  "bv1:20.6": "passanti lokanāyakaṃ. ",
  "bv1:21.1": "sadeva gandhabba manussarakkhasā ",
  "bv1:21.2": "nāgā supaṇṇā athavāpi kinnarā ",
  "bv1:21.3": "passanti taṃ lokahitānukampakaṃ ",
  "bv1:21.4": "nabheva accuggata candamaṇḍalaṃ. ",
  "bv1:22.1": "ābhassarā subhakiṇhā ",
  "bv1:22.2": "vehapphalā akaniṭṭhā ca susuddha sukka ",
  "bv1:22.3": "vattha vasanā ",
  "bv1:22.4": "tiṭṭhanti pañjalīkatā. ",
  "bv1:23.1": "muñcanti pupphaṃ pana pañcavaṇṇikaṃ ",
  "bv1:23.2": "mandāravaṃ candana cuṇṇa ",
  "bv1:23.3": "missakaṃ bhamanti celāni ca ambare tadā ",
  "bv1:23.4": "aho jino lokahitānukampako. ",
  "bv1:24.1": "tuvaṃ satthā ca ketu ca ",
  "bv1:24.2": "dhajo yūpo ca pāṇinaṃ ",
  "bv1:24.3": "parāyano patiṭṭhā ca ",
  "bv1:24.4": "dīpo ca dipaduttamo. ",
  "bv1:25.1": "dasasahassi lokadhātuyā ",
  "bv1:25.2": "devatāyo mahiddhikā ",
  "bv1:25.3": "parivāretvā namassanti ",
  "bv1:25.4": "tuṭṭhahaṭṭhā pamoditā. ",
  "bv1:26.1": "devatā devakaññā ca ",
  "bv1:26.2": "pasannā tuṭṭhamānasā ",
  "bv1:26.3": "pañcavaṇṇika pupphehi ",
  "bv1:26.4": "pūjayanti narāsabhaṃ. ",
  "bv1:27.1": "passanti taṃ devasaṅghā ",
  "bv1:27.2": "pasannā tuṭṭhamānasā ",
  "bv1:27.3": "pañcavaṇṇika pupphehi ",
  "bv1:27.4": "pūjayanti narāsabhaṃ. ",
  "bv1:28.1": "aho acchariyaṃ loke ",
  "bv1:28.2": "abbhūtaṃ lomahaṃsanaṃ ",
  "bv1:28.3": "na medisaṃ bhūtapubbaṃ ",
  "bv1:28.4": "accheraṃ lomahaṃsanaṃ. ",
  "bv1:29.1": "sakasakamhi bhavane ",
  "bv1:29.2": "nisīditvāna devatā ",
  "bv1:29.3": "hasanti tā mahāhasitaṃ ",
  "bv1:29.4": "disvānaccherakaṃ nabhe. ",
  "bv1:30.1": "ākāsaṭṭhā ca bhummaṭṭhā ",
  "bv1:30.2": "tiṇosadhinivāsino ",
  "bv1:30.3": "katañjalī namassanti ",
  "bv1:30.4": "tuṭṭha haṭṭhā pamoditā. ",
  "bv1:31.1": "yepi dīghāyukā nāgā ",
  "bv1:31.2": "puññavanto mahiddhikā ",
  "bv1:31.3": "pamoditā namassanti ",
  "bv1:31.4": "pūjayanti naruttamaṃ. ",
  "bv1:32.1": "saṅgītiyo pavattanti ",
  "bv1:32.2": "ambare anilañjase ",
  "bv1:32.3": "cammanaddhāni vādenti ",
  "bv1:32.4": "disvānaccherakaṃ nabhe. ",
  "bv1:33.1": "saṅkhā ca paṇavā ceva ",
  "bv1:33.2": "athopi deṇḍimā bahū ",
  "bv1:33.3": "antalikkhasmiṃ vajjayanti ",
  "bv1:33.4": "disvānaccherakaṃ nabhe. ",
  "bv1:34.1": "abbhūto vata no ajja ",
  "bv1:34.2": "uppajji lomahaṃsano ",
  "bv1:34.3": "dhuvamatthasiddhiṃ labhāma ",
  "bv1:34.4": "khaṇo no paṭipāṭito. ",
  "bv1:35.1": "buddhoti tesaṃ sutvāna ",
  "bv1:35.2": "pīti uppajji tāvade ",
  "bv1:35.3": "buddho buddhoti kathayantā ",
  "bv1:35.4": "tiṭṭhanti pañjalīkatā. ",
  "bv1:36.1": "hiṅkāraṃ sādhukārañca ",
  "bv1:36.2": "ukkuṭṭhi sampanādanaṃ ",
  "bv1:36.3": "pajā ca vividhā gagane ",
  "bv1:36.4": "vattanti pañjalīkatā. ",
  "bv1:37.1": "gāyanti seḷenti ca vādayanti ca ",
  "bv1:37.2": "bhujānipphoṭenti ca naccayanti ca ",
  "bv1:37.3": "muñcanti pupphaṃ pana pañcavaṇṇikaṃ ",
  "bv1:37.4": "mandāravaṃ candana cuṇṇa missakaṃ. ",
  "bv1:38.1": "yathā tuyhaṃ mahāvīra ",
  "bv1:38.2": "pādesu cakkalakkhaṇaṃ ",
  "bv1:38.3": "dhajaṃ vajirapaṭākaṃ ",
  "bv1:38.4": "vaḍḍhamānaṅkusāpitaṃ. ",
  "bv1:39.1": "rūpe sīle samādhimhi ",
  "bv1:39.2": "paññāya ca asādiso ",
  "bv1:39.3": "vimuttiyā asamasamo ",
  "bv1:39.4": "dhammacakkappavattane. ",
  "bv1:40.1": "dasanāgabalaṃ kāye ",
  "bv1:40.2": "tuyhaṃ pākatikaṃ balaṃ ",
  "bv1:40.3": "iddhibalena asamo ",
  "bv1:40.4": "dhammacakkappavattane. ",
  "bv1:41.1": "evaṃ sabbaguṇūpetaṃ ",
  "bv1:41.2": "sabbaṅga samupāgataṃ ",
  "bv1:41.3": "mahāmuniṃ kāruṇikaṃ ",
  "bv1:41.4": "lokanāthaṃ namassatha. ",
  "bv1:42.1": "abhivādanaṃ thomanañca ",
  "bv1:42.2": "vandanañca pasaṃsanaṃ ",
  "bv1:42.3": "namassanañca pūjañca ",
  "bv1:42.4": "sabbaṃ arahasī tuvaṃ. ",
  "bv1:43.1": "ye keci loke vandaneyyā ",
  "bv1:43.2": "vandanaṃ arahanti ye ",
  "bv1:43.3": "sabbaseṭṭho mahāvīra ",
  "bv1:43.4": "sadiso te na vijjati. ",
  "bv1:44.1": "sārīputto mahāpañño ",
  "bv1:44.2": "samādhi jjhānakovido ",
  "bv1:44.3": "gijjhakūṭe ṭhitoyeva ",
  "bv1:44.4": "passati lokanāyakaṃ. ",
  "bv1:45.1": "suphullaṃ sālarājaṃva ",
  "bv1:45.2": "candaṃva gagane yathā ",
  "bv1:45.3": "majjhantikeva suriyaṃ ",
  "bv1:45.4": "oloketi narāsabhaṃ. ",
  "bv1:46.1": "jalantaṃ dīparukkhaṃva ",
  "bv1:46.2": "taruṇasuriyaṃva uggataṃ ",
  "bv1:46.3": "byāmap pabhānurañjitaṃ ",
  "bv1:46.4": "passati lokanāyakaṃ. ",
  "bv1:47.1": "pañcannaṃ bhikkhusatānaṃ ",
  "bv1:47.2": "katakiccāna tādinaṃ ",
  "bv1:47.3": "khīṇāsavānaṃ vimalānaṃ ",
  "bv1:47.4": "khaṇena sannipātayi. ",
  "bv1:48.1": "lokap pasādanaṃ nāma ",
  "bv1:48.2": "pāṭihīraṃ nidassayi ",
  "bv1:48.3": "amhepi tattha gantvāna ",
  "bv1:48.4": "vandissāma mayaṃ jinaṃ. ",
  "bv1:49.1": "etha sabbe gamissāma ",
  "bv1:49.2": "pucchissāma mayaṃ jinaṃ ",
  "bv1:49.3": "kaṅkhaṃ vinodayissāma ",
  "bv1:49.4": "passitvā lokanāyakaṃ. ",
  "bv1:50.1": "sādhūti te paṭissutvā ",
  "bv1:50.2": "nipakā saṃvutindriyā ",
  "bv1:50.3": "patta cīvaramādāya ",
  "bv1:50.4": "taramānā upāgamuṃ. ",
  "bv1:51.1": "khīṇāsavehi vimalehi ",
  "bv1:51.2": "dantehi uttame dame ",
  "bv1:51.3": "sārīputto mahāpañño ",
  "bv1:51.4": "iddhiyā upasaṅkami. ",
  "bv1:52.1": "tehi bhikkhūhi parivuto ",
  "bv1:52.2": "sārīputto mahāgaṇī ",
  "bv1:52.3": "liḷanto devova gagane ",
  "bv1:52.4": "iddhiyā upasaṅkami. ",
  "bv1:53.1": "ukkāsitañca khipitañca ",
  "bv1:53.2": "ajjhupekkhitvāna subbatā ",
  "bv1:53.3": "sagāravā sappatissā ",
  "bv1:53.4": "sambuddhaṃ upasaṅkamuṃ. ",
  "bv1:54.1": "upasaṅkamitvā passanti ",
  "bv1:54.2": "sayambhuṃ lokanāyakaṃ ",
  "bv1:54.3": "nabhe accuggataṃ vīraṃ ",
  "bv1:54.4": "candaṃva gagane yathā. ",
  "bv1:55.1": "jalantaṃ dīparukkhaṃva ",
  "bv1:55.2": "vijjuva gagane yathā ",
  "bv1:55.3": "majjhantikeva suriyaṃ ",
  "bv1:55.4": "passanti lokanāyakaṃ. ",
  "bv1:56.1": "pañcabhikkhusatā sabbe ",
  "bv1:56.2": "passanti lokanāyakaṃ ",
  "bv1:56.3": "rahadamiva vippasannaṃ ",
  "bv1:56.4": "suphullaṃ padumaṃ yathā. ",
  "bv1:57.1": "añjaliṃ paggahetvāna ",
  "bv1:57.2": "tuṭṭha haṭṭhā pamoditā ",
  "bv1:57.3": "namassamānā nipatanti ",
  "bv1:57.4": "satthuno cakkalakkhaṇe. ",
  "bv1:58.1": "sārīputto mahāpañño ",
  "bv1:58.2": "koraṇḍa samasādiso ",
  "bv1:58.3": "samādhijjhāna kusalo ",
  "bv1:58.4": "vandati lokanāyakaṃ. ",
  "bv1:59.1": "gajjito kālameghova ",
  "bv1:59.2": "nīluppala samasādiso ",
  "bv1:59.3": "iddhibalena asamo ",
  "bv1:59.4": "moggallāno mahiddhiko. ",
  "bv1:60.1": "mahākassapatheropi uggata kanaka ",
  "bv1:60.2": "sannibho ",
  "bv1:60.3": "dhutaguṇe agga nikkhitto ",
  "bv1:60.4": "thomito satthuvaṇṇito. ",
  "bv1:61.1": "dibbacakkhūna yo aggo ",
  "bv1:61.2": "anuruddho mahāgaṇī ",
  "bv1:61.3": "ñātiseṭṭho bhagavato ",
  "bv1:61.4": "avidūreva tiṭṭhati. ",
  "bv1:62.1": "āpatti anāpattiyā ",
  "bv1:62.2": "satekicchāya kovido ",
  "bv1:62.3": "vinaye agga nikkhitto ",
  "bv1:62.4": "upāli satthu vaṇṇito. ",
  "bv1:63.1": "sukhuma nipuṇattha paṭividdho ",
  "bv1:63.2": "kathikānaṃ pavaro gaṇī ",
  "bv1:63.3": "isi mantāniyā putto ",
  "bv1:63.4": "puṇṇo nāmāti vissuto. ",
  "bv1:64.1": "etesaṃ cittamaññāya ",
  "bv1:64.2": "opamma kusalo muni ",
  "bv1:64.3": "kaṅkhac chedo mahāvīro ",
  "bv1:64.4": "kathesi attano guṇaṃ. ",
  "bv1:65.1": "cattāro te asaṅkheyyā ",
  "bv1:65.2": "koṭi yesaṃ na nāyati ",
  "bv1:65.3": "sattakāyo ca ākāso ",
  "bv1:65.4": "cakkavāḷā anantakā ",
  "bv1:65.5": "buddhañāṇaṃ appameyyaṃ ",
  "bv1:65.6": "na sakkā ete vijānituṃ. ",
  "bv1:66.1": "kimetaṃ acchariyaṃ loke ",
  "bv1:66.2": "yaṃ me iddhi vikubbanaṃ ",
  "bv1:66.3": "aññe bahū acchariyā ",
  "bv1:66.4": "abbhūtā lomahaṃsanā. ",
  "bv1:67.1": "yadāhaṃ tusite kāye ",
  "bv1:67.2": "santusito nāmahaṃ tadā ",
  "bv1:67.3": "dasasahassī samāgamma ",
  "bv1:67.4": "yācanti añjalī mamaṃ. ",
  "bv1:68.1": "kāloyaṃ te mahāvīra ",
  "bv1:68.2": "uppajja mātu kucchiyaṃ ",
  "bv1:68.3": "sadevakaṃ tārayanto ",
  "bv1:68.4": "bujjhassu amataṃ padaṃ. ",
  "bv1:69.1": "tusitā kāyā cavitvāna ",
  "bv1:69.2": "yadā okkami kucchiyaṃ ",
  "bv1:69.3": "dasasahassī lokadhātu ",
  "bv1:69.4": "kampati dharaṇī tadā. ",
  "bv1:70.1": "yadāhaṃ mātu kucchito ",
  "bv1:70.2": "sampajā nova nikkhamiṃ ",
  "bv1:70.3": "sādhukāraṃ pavattanti ",
  "bv1:70.4": "dasasahassī pakampatha. ",
  "bv1:71.1": "okkanti me samo natthi ",
  "bv1:71.2": "jātito abhinikkhame ",
  "bv1:71.3": "sambodhiyaṃ ahaṃ seṭṭho ",
  "bv1:71.4": "dhammacakkappavattane. ๚ ",
  "bv1:72.1": "aho acchariyaṃ loke ",
  "bv1:72.2": "buddhānaṃ guṇa mahantatā ",
  "bv1:72.3": "dasasahassī lokadhātu ",
  "bv1:72.4": "chappakāraṃ pakampatha ",
  "bv1:72.5": "obhāso ca mahā āsi ",
  "bv1:72.6": "accheraṃ lomahaṃsanaṃ. ",
  "bv1:73.1": "bhagavā ca tamhi samaye ",
  "bv1:73.2": "lokajeṭṭho narāsabho ",
  "bv1:73.3": "sadevakaṃ dassayanto ",
  "bv1:73.4": "iddhiyā caṅkamī jino. ",
  "bv1:74.1": "caṅkame caṅkamantova ",
  "bv1:74.2": "kathesi lokanāyako ",
  "bv1:74.3": "antarā na nivatteti ",
  "bv1:74.4": "catuhatthe caṅkame yathā. ",
  "bv1:75.1": "sārīputto mahāpañño ",
  "bv1:75.2": "samādhi jjhāna kovido ",
  "bv1:75.3": "paññāya pāramip patto ",
  "bv1:75.4": "pucchati lokanāyakaṃ. ",
  "bv1:76.1": "kīdiso te mahāvīra ",
  "bv1:76.2": "abhinīhāro naruttama ",
  "bv1:76.3": "kimhi kāle tayā vīra ",
  "bv1:76.4": "patthitā bodhi muttamā. ",
  "bv1:77.1": "dānaṃ sīlañca nekkhammaṃ ",
  "bv1:77.2": "paññā viriyañca kīdisaṃ ",
  "bv1:77.3": "khanti sacca madhiṭṭhānaṃ ",
  "bv1:77.4": "mettūpekkhā ca kīdisā. ",
  "bv1:78.1": "dasapāramī mahāvīra ",
  "bv1:78.2": "kīdisā lokanāyaka ",
  "bv1:78.3": "kathaṃ upapāramī puṇṇā ",
  "bv1:78.4": "paramatthapāramī kathaṃ. ",
  "bv1:79.1": "[katikamma adhiṭṭhāya adhipati ca kīdisā kīdisā pāramī honti dhīrā lokasmi kīdisā. mettā karuṇā muditā upekkhā cāpi kīdisā kīdisaṃ buddhadhammānaṃ kevalaṃ paripūraya] tassa puṭṭho viyākāsi ",
  "bv1:79.2": "karavīkamadhuragiro ",
  "bv1:79.3": "nibbāpayanto hadayaṃ ",
  "bv1:79.4": "hāsayanto sadevakaṃ. ",
  "bv1:80.1": "atītabuddhāna jināna desitaṃ ",
  "bv1:80.2": "nikīḷitaṃ buddha paramparāgataṃ ",
  "bv1:80.3": "pubbe nivāsānugatāya buddhiyā ",
  "bv1:80.4": "pakāsayī lokahitaṃ sadevake. ",
  "bv1:81.1": "pīti pāmojja jananaṃ ",
  "bv1:81.2": "soka salla vinodanaṃ ",
  "bv1:81.3": "sabbasampattipaṭilābhaṃ ",
  "bv1:81.4": "cittaṃ katvā suṇātha me. ",
  "bv1:82.1": "madanimmadanaṃ sokanudaṃ ",
  "bv1:82.2": "saṃsāraparimocanaṃ ",
  "bv1:82.3": "sabbadukkhakkhayaṃ maggaṃ ",
  "bv1:82.4": "sakkaccaṃ paṭipajjatha. ",
  "bv1:83.1": "ratanacaṅkamanakaṇḍo niṭṭhito. "
}
